* ''The sealing scope'' (operator, 2026-11-06, approving the house's defaults; from the 2026-10-12 ruling). Every wiki content store (each bag's CRDT document, on node and browser) and the CAD/CAS store rest sealed; planes and boards stay clear and hold signed acts only, never a private payload, save that the sealed store's T1 stands overturned for persona planes alone (operator, 2026-11-18: //"This sounds like a pono design to move forwards with"//; lar:///ha.ka.ba/kahua/memory/research/persona-selves-sealed): a face's two own names leave its plane for a ''selves record'' per face, a document of its own sealed under the face's key group and opened after the lift, while the plane keeps only the signed public acts the floor folds; cleartext rests only in the disk projection and the live wiki in memory; a public bag rests under its published key. The sealed-store carrier's #/owed holds it, carried by the b1 lanes' carriers at their land.

